Z||000004||Formula88||06-27-2001||04:45 PM||||Well, I just put in Rodney's 180 thermo & switch and the fan kicks on and off exactly when I expect it to.  Sounds like your gauge is reading off.  You could always swap back to the original to see if it behaves the same way, but at a higher temp.<P>Does it not come on at all sometimes?  That could be a defective switch, or a host of other issues.||||reg||1
